{
 "id": "seg5",
 "title": "检查站",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 128.5,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "再看交易所的另一张面孔，检查站。",
   "spoken": "再看交易所的另一张面孔，检查站。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.488
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "这里的攻击者，不需要攻破交易所的系统，只需要规则有漏洞。",
   "spoken": "这里的攻击者，不需要攻破交易所的系统，只需要规则有漏洞。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-01.wav",
   "start": 4.94,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 5.037,
   "speechEnd": 9.863
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "盗来的资金，想充进交易所，再提走或者换掉。",
   "spoken": "盗来的资金，想充进交易所，再提走或者换掉。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-02.wav",
   "start": 10.28,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 10.381,
   "speechEnd": 14.393
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "名单上的人，换个新地址、新账户，绕过筛查。",
   "spoken": "名单上的人，换个新地址、新账户，绕过筛查。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-03.wav",
   "start": 14.82,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 14.916,
   "speechEnd": 19.09
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "洗钱者把金额拆开，快进快出。",
   "spoken": "洗钱者把金额拆开，快进快出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-04.wav",
   "start": 19.52,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 19.52,
   "speechEnd": 22.585
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "TRM 记录到，Binance 事件前一天，攻击者的操作钱包，收到 3 笔 Tornado Cash 提款。",
   "spoken": "TRM 记录到，Binance 事件前一天，攻击者的操作钱包，收到 3 笔 Tornado Cash 提款。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-05.wav",
   "start": 23.02,
   "dur": 6.88,
   "speechStart": 23.115,
   "speechEnd": 29.671
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "一笔充值或者提币，要过四道关。",
   "spoken": "一笔充值或者提币，要过四道关。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-06.wav",
   "start": 30.12,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 30.217,
   "speechEnd": 33.065
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "第一道，制裁筛查，比如美国财政部 OFAC 的名单，命中就拦。",
   "spoken": "第一道，制裁筛查，比如美国财政部 OFAC 的名单，命中就拦。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-07.wav",
   "start": 33.46,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 33.558,
   "speechEnd": 39.039
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "第二道，链上风险评分，看资金在几跳以内，是不是来自被盗资金或者混币器。",
   "spoken": "第二道，链上风险评分，看资金在几跳以内，是不是来自被盗资金或者混币器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-08.wav",
   "start": 39.44,
   "dur": 7.6,
   "speechStart": 39.533,
   "speechEnd": 46.824
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "第三道，Travel Rule，服务商之间转账，要传递发起人和受益人的信息。",
   "spoken": "第三道，Travel Rule，服务商之间转账，要传递发起人和受益人的信息。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-09.wav",
   "start": 47.26,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 47.26,
   "speechEnd": 53.505
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "第四道，反洗钱交易监控，盯住拆分和快进快出。",
   "spoken": "第四道，反洗钱交易监控，盯住拆分和快进快出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-10.wav",
   "start": 53.96,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 54.06,
   "speechEnd": 59.001
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "门槛要按辖区来定。",
   "spoken": "门槛要按辖区来定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-11.wav",
   "start": 59.46,
   "dur": 1.92,
   "speechStart": 59.46,
   "speechEnd": 61.222
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "FATF 建议的门槛，是 1000 美元或欧元。",
   "spoken": "FATF 建议的门槛，是 1000 美元或欧元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-12.wav",
   "start": 61.6,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 61.6,
   "speechEnd": 65.354
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "欧盟规定，服务商之间转账，不设最低门槛。",
   "spoken": "欧盟规定，服务商之间转账，不设最低门槛。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-13.wav",
   "start": 65.82,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 65.916,
   "speechEnd": 69.455
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "系统如果按 1000 欧元设计，小额转账就缺了发起人和受益人的信息。",
   "spoken": "系统如果按 1000 欧元设计，小额转账就缺了发起人和受益人的信息。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-14.wav",
   "start": 69.88,
   "dur": 7.28,
   "speechStart": 69.88,
   "speechEnd": 76.948
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "被盗资金进入交易所，往往是冻结追回的最后机会。",
   "spoken": "被盗资金进入交易所，往往是冻结追回的最后机会。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-15.wav",
   "start": 77.38,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 77.476,
   "speechEnd": 81.751
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "Binance 事件当晚，Tether 冻结了约 9.711 亿 USDT，Circle 冻结了约 8.23 亿 USDC。",
   "spoken": "Binance 事件当晚，Tether 冻结了约 9.711 亿 USDT，Circle 冻结了约 8.23 亿 USDC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-16.wav",
   "start": 82.16,
   "dur": 7.92,
   "speechStart": 82.258,
   "speechEnd": 89.906
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "比特币、XRP 这类原生资产，发行方没办法冻结。",
   "spoken": "比特币、XRP 这类原生资产，发行方没办法冻结。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-17.wav",
   "start": 90.3,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 90.408,
   "speechEnd": 94.918
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "检查站失守，代价最后会回到交易所身上。",
   "spoken": "检查站失守，代价最后会回到交易所身上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-18.wav",
   "start": 95.32,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 95.32,
   "speechEnd": 98.728
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-19",
   "text": "2023 年 11 月，Binance 认罪，支付约 43 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 11 月，Binance 认罪，支付约 43 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-19.wav",
   "start": 99.14,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 99.237,
   "speechEnd": 103.537
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-20",
   "text": "2025 年，KuCoin 和 OKX，也认罪无牌汇款。",
   "spoken": "2025 年，KuCoin 和 OKX，也认罪无牌汇款。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-20.wav",
   "start": 103.92,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 104.024,
   "speechEnd": 108.191
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-21",
   "text": "反过来，评分也会误报，没有人工复核和申诉通道，正常用户的钱就会被错冻。",
   "spoken": "反过来，评分也会误报，没有人工复核和申诉通道，正常用户的钱就会被错冻。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-21.wav",
   "start": 108.62,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 108.62,
   "speechEnd": 115.594
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-22",
   "text": "Tornado Cash 在 2025 年 3 月被移出制裁名单，可风险没有跟着消失。",
   "spoken": "Tornado Cash 在 2025 年 3 月被移出制裁名单，可风险没有跟着消失。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-22.wav",
   "start": 116.04,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 116.04,
   "speechEnd": 122.438
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-23",
   "text": "混币器来的钱，照样要按评分和规则走一遍。",
   "spoken": "混币器来的钱，照样要按评分和规则走一遍。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg5-23.wav",
   "start": 122.82,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 122.82,
   "speechEnd": 127.088
  }
